eft" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135427332.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India's External Affairs Minister S Jaishankar has discussed the protection of civilian shipping with Russia, Ukraine, and European nations. Efforts are being made to restore grain exports through the Black Sea, which have significantly declined. Additionally, the safety of energy infrastructure and fuel shipments is a major concern amid the ongoing conflict. Different interpretations of energy infrastructure complicate discussions on protection measures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-trying-to-bring-russia-ukraine-europe-to-the-table-on-3-fronts-jaishankar/articleshow/135427332.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-trying-to-bring-russia-ukraine-europe-to-the-table-on-3-fronts-jaishankar/articleshow/135427332.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T17:54:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135427380,imgsize-131472.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Super flop rally': BJP says Ramlila Maidan '40% empty', mocks INDIA bloc protest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135426536.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T17:27:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135426660,imgsize-1001373.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul's Ramlila 'jalsa' to 'rub salt in wounds' of 1984 Sikh riot victims: Amit Shah]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135423470.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Union home minister Amit Shah said the "jalsa" would reopen painful memories for the victims and their families, accusing the Congress of showing little sensitivity towards the tragedy. Shah made the remarks in Chandigarh while addressing a gathering after inaugurating and laying the foundation stones for development projects worth Rs 258 crore.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:45:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425486,imgsize-109382.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stay quiet or I'll speak for an hour': Kharge's playful warning to supporters at Ramlila Maidan rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stay-quiet-or-ill-speak-for-an-hour-kharges-playful-warning-to-supporters-at-ramlila-maidan-rally/articleshow/135425070.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135425070.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stay-quiet-or-ill-speak-for-an-hour-kharges-playful-warning-to-supporters-at-ramlila-maidan-rally/articleshow/135425070.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stay-quiet-or-ill-speak-for-an-hour-kharges-playful-warning-to-supporters-at-ramlila-maidan-rally/articleshow/135425070.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:35:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425201,imgsize-85976.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['After Gyanesh, you are next': Rahul Gandhi says PM Modi, Amit Shah will face justice for 'vote chori']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/after-gyanesh-you-are-next-rahul-gandhi-says-pm-modi-amit-shah-will-face-justice-for-vote-chori/articleshow/135424966.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135424966.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/after-gyanesh-you-are-next-rahul-gandhi-says-pm-modi-amit-shah-will-face-justice-for-vote-chori/articleshow/135424966.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/after-gyanesh-you-are-next-rahul-gandhi-says-pm-modi-amit-shah-will-face-justice-for-vote-chori/articleshow/135424966.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:27:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425022,imgsize-32410.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Gyanesh, when will you vanish?': Mamata mocks CEC; Akhilesh invokes Haldighati - who said what at INDIA bloc rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-mamata-mocks-gyanesh-kumar-akhilesh-says-parivartan-can-come-anytime-who-said-what/articleshow/135424656.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135424656.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a rally at Ramlila Maidan on Sunday, senior leaders from the INDIA coalition raised alarms about electoral roll manipulation. They accused the BJP of endangering democracy through the Chief Election Commissioner. Opposition leaders like Rahul Gandhi and Mamata Banerjee demanded Gyanesh Kumar's removal and vowed to continue their campaign against him.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-mamata-mocks-gyanesh-kumar-akhilesh-says-parivartan-can-come-anytime-who-said-what/articleshow/135424656.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-mamata-mocks-gyanesh-kumar-akhilesh-says-parivartan-can-come-anytime-who-said-what/articleshow/135424656.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:17:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425899,imgsize-100732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Will dig you out from ground, if needed’: Kharge warns CEC Gyanesh Kumar at INDIA bloc rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135424349.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:04:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135424543,imgsize-76810.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Did they really have to choose this day?’ BJP targets Congress over INDIA bloc rally on anniversary of 1984 riots]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135423866.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP organized a protest march in West Delhi's Hari Nagar demanding an apology from Congress for the 1984 anti-Sikh violence. Union minister Hardeep Singh Puri described the killings as a well-planned genocide rather than a riot. Several leaders participated in the march, expressing concerns over Congress's perceived failure to acknowledge the tragedy. The protest coincided with the opposition's rally addressing electoral irregularities on the same day.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T15:56:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135424262,imgsize-1248694.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Deeply shameful’: Tharoor slams UK over colonialism omission in slavery apology]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/deeply-shameful-tharoor-slams-uk-over-colonialism-omission-in-slavery-apology/articleshow/135422395.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135422395.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Responding to British Prime Minister Andy Burnham's remarks in a post on X on Saturday, Shashi Tharoor said he had long maintained that putting a monetary figure on the damage caused by British rule was difficult. He also said Britain had never formally apologised for the destruction and exploitation carried out during its colonial rule.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/deeply-shameful-tharoor-slams-uk-over-colonialism-omission-in-slavery-apology/articleshow/135422395.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/deeply-shameful-tharoor-slams-uk-over-colonialism-omission-in-slavery-apology/articleshow/135422395.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T14:52:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135422762,imgsize-87906.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[DGCA mandates twin pilot operations from Monday, chopper operators threaten to suspend Char Dam flights]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dgca-mandates-twin-pilot-operations-from-monday-chopper-operators-threaten-to-suspend-char-dam-flights/articleshow/135422848.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135422848.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dgca-mandates-twin-pilot-operations-from-monday-chopper-operators-threaten-to-suspend-char-dam-flights/articleshow/135422848.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dgca-mandates-twin-pilot-operations-from-monday-chopper-operators-threaten-to-suspend-char-dam-flights/articleshow/135422848.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T14:49:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Saurabh Sinha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135422930,imgsize-162983.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Why do you challenge democracy?' BJP chief Nitin Nabin accuses Rahul Gandhi of acting on behest of foreign powers]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-you-challenge-democracy-bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-acting-on-behest-of-foreign-powers/articleshow/135421577.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135421577.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP leader Nitin Nabin accused Congress leader Rahul Gandhi of furthering foreign agendas at a rally in Haryana. Nabin criticized Congress for claiming democracy is at risk only when it loses elections in multiple states. He challenged allegations regarding voter deletion and past election irregularities linked to the party’s leadership. Nabin emphasized the need for governance based on the Constitution rather than dynastic politics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-you-challenge-democracy-bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-acting-on-behest-of-foreign-powers/articleshow/135421577.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-do-you-challenge-democracy-bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-accuses-rahul-gandhi-of-acting-on-behest-of-foreign-powers/articleshow/135421577.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T14:14:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135422167,imgsize-925937.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Every single shop forcibly shut': Rahul Gandhi targets BJP over Connaught Place closures during mega rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/every-single-shop-forcibly-shut-rahul-gandhi-targets-bjp-over-connaught-place-closures-during-mega-rally/articleshow/135421919.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135421919.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/every-single-shop-forcibly-shut-rahul-gandhi-targets-bjp-over-connaught-place-closures-during-mega-rally/articleshow/135421919.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/every-single-shop-forcibly-shut-rahul-gandhi-targets-bjp-over-connaught-place-closures-during-mega-rally/articleshow/135421919.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T14:08:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135422042,imgsize-110554.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Cutting 130m voters unacceptable': Shashi Tharoor targets EC amid INDIA bloc's Ramlila Maidan rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cutting-130m-voters-unacceptable-shashi-tharoor-targets-ec-amid-india-blocs-ramlila-maidan-rally/articleshow/135421216.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135421216.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link